  "title": "Delicious Sweet Potato Scones",
  "description": "These quick and easy sweet potato scones studded with raisins and spiced with cinnamon and nutmeg are a tasty, nutritious breakfast treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Jean Harrington"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:19:18-04:00",
